flowchart TD
  W[Webhook: PR opened / CI event] --> PL[Agent: plan change]
  PL --> T{Select tool via MCP}
  T --> RD[read files] & ED[edit code] & RN[run tests / CI]
  RD --> OB[Observe result]
  ED --> OB
  RN --> OB
  OB --> CK{Done? budget left? loop detected?}
  CK -- continue --> PL
  CK -- budget/loop limit --> HITL[Escalate to human]
  CK -- done --> VF[Validate: tests pass + diff review]
  VF -- pass --> PR[Comment / propose commit on PR]
  VF -- fail --> HITL
  PR --> HR[Human reviewer approves]
